docs {
  ## Cancel Order — Already Cancelled

  Tests cancelling an already CANCELLED order.
  Replace `CANCELLED_ORDER_UUID` with an order that is already CANCELLED.

  Expected: 400 Bad Request — "Order is already cancelled"
}
